{
  "id": 436996682,
  "iid": 22549,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "MEGACO: Handle tvb_find_uint8() returning -1",
  "description": "When dissecting a media descriptor, handle tvb_find_uint8 returning\n-1 when searching for a left or right bracket and not finding it\nby setting the bracket offset to the end offset so that the loop\nwill exit. Leaving it at -1 can cause going backwards and at worst\ninfinite loops.\n\nFix #20884",
